+{"scenario_id": "full-089", "scenario_group": "challenge", "model": "gpt-5.5", "status": "completed", "error": null, "turns": [{"user": "Can you check the status of my daypack order from Meridian Cycles?", "agent": "I found two Meridian Cycles daypack orders on your account:\n\n- **Most recent order #5231 \u2014 Everyday Daypack**\n  - **Status:** Delivered\n  - **Ordered:** June 19, 2026\n  - **Shipped:** June 22, 2026\n  - **Delivered:** June 24, 2026\n  - **Total:** $50.75\n\n- **Older order #3659 \u2014 Everyday Daypack**\n  - **Status:** Refunded\n  - **Ordered:** March 13, 2026\n  - **Delivered:** March 16, 2026\n\nYour current/recent daypack order appears to be **order #5231**, and it has been **delivered**."}, {"user": "Actually, I think I want to return it. The zipper is already broken.", "agent": "I\u2019m sorry the zipper failed \u2014 that\u2019s frustrating, especially on a daypack.\n\nI checked **order #5231** for your Meridian Cycles **Everyday Daypack**:\n\n- **Status:** Delivered  \n- **Delivered on:** June 24, 2026  \n- **Order total:** $50.75  \n- The order system marks it as **refund-eligible**, but there\u2019s a policy complication.\n\nMeridian Cycles has a store-specific return window of **21 days from delivery**, which overrides Cartwheel\u2019s standard 30-day window (**store-meridian-cycles-policy**, **cw-returns**). Since this was delivered on June 24 and today is September 15, it\u2019s outside the normal return window.\n\nBecause this is a **defect issue** \u2014 not just a standard return \u2014 I\u2019ve escalated it to a human support agent for review rather than denying it or processing it incorrectly.\n\n**Ticket #162** has been opened. A human support agent should follow up within **24 hours** with the next steps. If a refund is approved, Cartwheel refunds go back to the original payment method and typically arrive in **5\u201310 business days** (**cw-refunds**)."}, {"user": "How long will the refund take to show up on my card?", 