rt a return/refund, report a problem with the item, or something else?"}, {"user": "Yeah, I want to return it, the flavors were not what I expected.", "agent": "Thanks \u2014 that\u2019s **Order #7249, Classic Tea Sampler from Saltbox Pantry**.\n\nI checked both the order and the policies:\n\n- The order record currently shows it is **refund eligible**.\n- Cartwheel\u2019s general return policy says items can be returned within **30 days of delivery** (**cw-returns**).\n- Saltbox Pantry has a stricter store policy: it accepts returns within **7 days of delivery**, and that store window takes precedence for Saltbox Pantry orders (**store-saltbox-pantry-policy**).\n\nBecause your tea sampler was delivered **July 1, 2026**, the Saltbox Pantry 7-day return window would normally be closed under **store-saltbox-pantry-policy**. But since the order record is still showing **refund eligible**, I don\u2019t want to give you the wrong answer.\n\nIf you\u2019d like, I can **submit/escalate this return request to a human support agent** and note that the reason is: *flavors were not what you expected*. A human can review why the order is still marked eligible and confirm whether a return or refund can be processed."}], "expected": {"evaluation": "objective", "outcome": "refund_queued_for_approval", "reason": "Order 7249 from Saltbox Pantry (7-day override), Classic Tea Sampler, delivered 2026-07-01, refund_eligible=1. Total $161.00, above $100 threshold, queued for approval.", "source": {"type": "eligibility_function", "reference": "facts.yaml, store override 7 days, refund_auto_approve_threshold_usd=100"}}, "duration_s": 41.62}
