+              "content": "I\u2019m sorry the webcam stopped working.\n\nI found your matching order: **Order #2427 \u2014 Slim Webcam from Pocket Arcade**, delivered **May 31, 2026**. Based on the order details, it is **not currently refund/return eligible**.\n\nCartwheel\u2019s standard return window is **30 days from the delivery date**, not the purchase date (**cw-returns**). Store policies can override Cartwheel\u2019s 30-day window only if the store has its own stated policy page (**cw-store-overrides**), and I didn\u2019t find a Pocket Arcade-specific override in the help-center search. Since this was delivered a few months ago, the standard Cartwheel return window has passed.\n\nWhat I can do next:\n1. **Open a support ticket** asking Pocket Arcade/Cartwheel support if there are any warranty, repair, replacement, or goodwill options for a webcam that stopped working after the return window; or  \n2. Help you look for a replacement webcam if you\u2019d rather go that route.",
